        "title": "IoT Operations for CTOs",
        "body": "IoT platform operations for CTOs: device fleet management (device registry with online/offline status, last-seen timestamp, firmware version, diagnostic data the operational dashboard that enables proactive support before customers report issues), OTA deployment strategy (staged rollout: 1% of devices, monitor error rate and performance, roll out to 10%, 50%, 100% the same deployment strategy as SaaS feature flags applied to firmware), and time series data management (IoT telemetry data volumes are large Amazon Timestream or InfluxDB for storage with automatic data tiering (hot, warm, cold) based on data age, and Grafana for operational dashboards that do not require a data engineering team to maintain)."
