        "answer": "App Store rating management: in-app review prompt (Apple SKStoreRequestReview and Google Play In-App Review API trigger after a positive user action (successful task completion, return visit after 7 days) prompt timing determines opt-in quality (a prompt after a negative experience generates a 1-star review, after a positive experience generates a 4-5 star review)), review response (App Store Connect and Google Play Console both allow developers to respond to reviews publicly responding to negative reviews with a solution or acknowledgement improves both the specific reviewer's experience and signals responsiveness to prospective users), and review velocity (the App Store algorithm weights recent reviews a campaign to generate reviews from satisfied users (email or push notification to high-engagement users) can improve the rating and search ranking). ClickMasters implements SKStoreRequestReview and Play In-App Review with PM-configurable trigger conditions in every mobile product engagement."
